      <h2 class="gate-docs-heading">Auto-Fix Language Support</h2>
      <p class="gate-docs-text">Gate's auto-fix engine understands language-specific syntax. It extracts hardcoded secrets to .env files and rewrites the source to reference environment variables using the correct idiom for each language.</p>
