    <!-- Credential Verification -->
    <div class="gate-docs-section reveal" id="docs-verification">
      <h2 class="gate-docs-heading">Credential Verification</h2>
      <p class="gate-docs-text">Verification is <strong>off by default</strong> — Gate never touches the network unless you ask. Run <code>gate verify</code> (or <code>gate scan --verify</code>) to make read-only API calls checking whether detected credentials are still active. This tells you which secrets need immediate rotation versus which are already expired or invalid.</p>

      <ul class="gate-docs-list">
        <li>Opt-in only -- no implicit network calls with detected secrets</li>
        <li>Read-only API calls only -- no writes, no mutations</li>
        <li>2-second timeout per verification call</li>
        <li>Results are cacheable to avoid repeated checks</li>
      </ul>

      <p class="gate-docs-text">Supported providers:</p>

